Package: kuteditor
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 pipewire-jack | jackd2,
Description: Native podcast editor with multitrack audio and chapters
 KutEditor is a Qt6/QML podcast editor with multitrack recording and
 editing, a per-track effects chain (compressor, limiter, equaliser,
 noise gate, de-esser, auto-duck), noise reduction through RNNoise and
 DeepFilterNet, and Podcasting 2.0 chapter markers written as ID3v2
 CHAP frames.
 .
 Audio input and output go through the JACK API, which PipeWire
 implements, so no separate JACK server is required on a PipeWire
 system.
